								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=274"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg14673#msg14673"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg14673#msg14673">Re: Ex-Hegemony</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> February 16, 2005, 03:46:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I guess I could take Somthing off ignore some day..&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />[added later]&nbsp; I guess in addition to being a wise-ass I could approach answering the question.&nbsp; I&#039;m back into the family guild scene and enjoying a &#039;simpler&#039; life.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/saint.gif" alt="Saint" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
