								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg14684#msg14684">Re: Ex-Hegemony</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> February 16, 2005, 05:29:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
