								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Heya all.&nbsp; Say hello to Kirishu for me Somthing.&nbsp; (You know I had to break the rules to allow her to recruit, don&#039;t you?&nbsp; Ah, the good ol&#039; days...)&nbsp; Good to see ya Binthaf.&nbsp; And Darken, I still visit the old alma mater sometimes (coincidentally, we went to the same small high school).&nbsp; If you ever come through, look me up, won&#039;t ya?<br /><br />Serp.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
