							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							OMG, I just now saw this topic. <br /><br />Ahh, I miss all of you&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/missyou.gif" alt="missyou" border="0" /><br /><br />Lol Serepi, what is funny is that I ended up playing the BST as my main again anyways, so only kinda not really&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br /><br />As for me I moved onto EiE, and have loved everyday of it. Great bunch of people in the aliance&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bondage.gif" alt="bondage" border="0" /><br /><br />So how is retirment coming along and or the &quot;other&quot; games?
						</td>
