	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17493"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=309" title="View the profile of Roinin">Roinin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 18<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=309"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg17493#msg17493"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg17493#msg17493">Re: Ex-Hegemony</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> June 08, 2005, 05:56:42 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I, sirs, have ascended to WoW, which to this day, has in my opinion, floundered as a MMORPG. Blizzard has no fucking clue how to itemize casters, vesrus melee items in end game, and thus you see a tremdous mudflation to melee vs caster dps in end game. EQ did pretty well towards the end, but as OoW neared end game, you could define melee dps mudflation rather easily.&nbsp; Example given is Rogue doig twice, yes twice the dps (400-450 dps with&nbsp; gutgore/core hound tooth?!?!) as opposed to mage or even warlock hovering at 150-200ish dps in Molten Core/Onyxia.&nbsp; I expect no less as complete bullshit program design in Blackwing Lair, but alas where do i go from here? I await Vangaurd, the most promising game on the horizon, atm.<br /><br />Anyways, not to bitch about&nbsp; itemization, but I have returned to EQ for the time being, and alot of familiar faces have since left. If you wish to chat for whatever, shoot me a tell in the late evenings when I log on (11 cst and onward)&nbsp; or PM me here when ever&nbsp; decide to check this&nbsp; board. I&#039;ve talked to a few Ex- Hegemony people, yet the feeling I&#039;m left with is a hollowness that cannot be described. People who know me may relate to what I had invested, as well as everyone involved in Hege, but shrug, I miss ya&#039;s<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=266327" target="_blank">Roinin Unsleep</a> (outdated)<br /><a href="http://wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?id=17116" target="_blank">Ro Unsleep</a> (outdated)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
