							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg17704#msg17704"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1426.msg17704#msg17704">Re: Ex-Hegemony</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> July 05, 2005, 01:38:14 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							lol, i checked out FoT, they folded..&nbsp; Checked out Conviction, told em to kiss my ass...&nbsp; Checked out DA, their ranger hated me cuz i was too seXah.&nbsp; Went to DN and found my play time cut short.&nbsp; So now Im guildless and not playing much till RL calms down..<br /><br />BTW, I tried WoW and loved it for about ummmmm.......6 hours...&nbsp; Then I came back to EQ...
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
