							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hey guys!  gamehenge here <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />  /cough <br />well I occasionally play Counter Strike, but that is it, EQ was the only video game i ever got into (axamagoura you punk!).  I have thought of returning to EQ, then I have to quiet that thought like its an old heroin habit.  I do miss you guys alot!&nbsp; We had a tight group going for awhile, and those were some great times while we were underdogs.&nbsp; I miss most of you and I would love to hear from you!!&nbsp; my email is <a href="mailto:gamehenge420L@yahoo.com">gamehenge420L@yahoo.com</a> please drop me a line and let me know what you all up to now.<br /><br />/smile <br /><br />&nbsp;
						</td>
